        "## 🏷️ 1. Class Attribute\n",
        "👉 **Definition**\n",
        "\n",
        "A class attribute is shared by all objects (instances) of the class.\n",
        "\n",
        "✅ **Key Points**\n",
        "- Defined outside __init__\n",
        "- Same value for every object\n",
        "- Stored in the class itself"
